
@startuml
title implement (kanban and scrum) Workflow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
  BorderColor #2874A6
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FCF3CF
  DiamondBorderColor #B7950B
  StartColor #239B56
  EndColor #C0392B
}
start
:pick the most prioritize backlog;
:product test;
:implement;
:Create PR;
:product document and release sop;
:Merge to stage;
stop
@enduml